  message: "2026-11-23: still open after PR #2347, which changed only how a Robot variable's id is named. Fixture on dev 49bc5c6e4: '&{d}=    Create Dictionary    a=1' still makes a call edge to robot:external:0-0:&:external_symbol; a test in a.robot calling 'Shared Keyword', declared in both a.robot and b.robot, resolves to b.robot's keyword (last write wins). The FOR line made no call edge in this fixture; harbor was not re-run. Related: @{LIST} and &{DICT} in *** Variables *** emit no symbol (WI-saliz-mokik-ramap-gutit-mamij-dofuv-zovud-julin)."  # 4fc8
